    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8123" root="حشم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُشُمٌ</span></b>  Persons <i>having,</i> or <i>possessing,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَوُو</span>, as in
the explanation of IAar, for which <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذُو</span> is erroneously substituted in the copies of the K, TA,)
<i>consummate shame, shyness, bashfulness,</i> or <i>pudency.</i> (IAar, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَشَمٌ</span>.

